		(property "BOM Comments" "Price est. 3 A/pin with 22 AWG only (lower for thinner wire); the BEC pin may carry up to the 3 A BEC limit = 100 % of the XH rating; servo stall 2.3 A = 77 %. Re-terminate ESC and servo leads only if they are 22 AWG (gauge TBD, measure); otherwise use a 22 AWG adapter lead. XH (2.50 mm) does not mate with stock 2.54 mm servo plugs. Pins: 1 GND, 2 +6V_BEC, 3 signal (see fab_handoff.md)"
